## Explicitly declined in this VTID
Did NOT flip OPERATOR_AWS_READONLY_ENABLED on staging. Read
aws-ecs-readonly.ts's own header comment first: the "read-only" AWS tool
currently shares the SAME broad IAM role as the gateway's task-launching
path (ecs:RunTask) because the narrower STS-assumed role was never built.
Flipping it on would let the Operator's tool-calling LLM (DeepSeek by
default per VTID-03817) operate under a role that can also launch
arbitrary ECS tasks — a real privilege-escalation surface, not a dormant
flag. Scoping the actual IAM fix is a separate VTID.

